# Build output. The repo root's .gitignore predates the C# work and has no
# bin/obj rules; the companion tree is covered elsewhere, this project is not.
bin/
obj/

# Findings are evidence for one run on one radio. The conclusions belong in the
# experiment record, which is where a reader looks; a checked-in JSON would go
# stale against the next radio and invite being read as current.
findings*.json

# The package layout is STAGED build output plus two authored files. Everything
# run-packaged.ps1 copies in is ignored; the manifest and the logo are not.
package/*
!package/AppxManifest.xml
!package/logo.png
